-// ----------------------------------------------------------------------
-// StrCat()
-//    This merges the given strings or integers, with no delimiter. This
-//    is designed to be the fastest possible way to construct a string out
-//    of a mix of raw C strings, string_views, strings, and integer values.
-// ----------------------------------------------------------------------
