-TEST(Split, EmptyAndNull) {
-  // Attention: Splitting a null shield_absl::string_view is different than splitting
-  // an empty shield_absl::string_view even though both string_views are considered
-  // equal. This behavior is likely surprising and undesirable. However, to
-  // maintain backward compatibility, there is a small "hack" in
