-// http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/009695399/basedefs/xbd_chap08.html.
-//
-// The current POSIX spec for America/Los_Angeles is "PST8PDT,M3.2.0,M11.1.0",
-// which would be broken down as ...
